{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Proposition","doco:Section"],"label":"prop:categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists","kind":"proposition","title":"Existence of the categorical $q$-exterior derivative","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/def-categorical-q-ext-deriv"],"proofs":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prf-categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists"],"tags":["existence","q-ext-deriv","q-deformed"],"leanRef":"qou:QOU.CategoricalQExtDeriv.exists","text":"categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists.md","leanSource":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists.lean","provenance":"authored","html":"<a id=\"prop:categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists\"></a><p>Let <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\mathbf{C}, A, \\tau)</code> be a\n<a href=\"#def:quantum-observable-universe\">quantum observable universe</a> with\nconnection <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\nabla</code>, substrate parameter <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>, and weight\ndecomposition <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">(\\pi_H, \\pi_V)</code>.  Then the\n<a href=\"#def:categorical-q-ext-deriv\"><code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-deformed exterior derivative</a></p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-math math-display\">  d_q \\;=\\; q^{-1} d + (1 - q^{-1})  \\pi_V \\circ d\n  \\;\\colon\\; \\Omega^k(A) \\to \\Omega^{k+1}(A)</code></pre>\n<p>exists as a morphism in <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">\\mathbf{C}</code> for every <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">k</code>.</p>\n<p>Uniqueness is established separately in\n<a href=\"#prop:categorical-q-ext-deriv-unique\">uniqueness of categorical <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">q</code>-exterior derivative</a>.</p>\n","source":"folio/quantum-observable-universe/quantum-observable-universes/categorical-q-ext-deriv-exists.md","leanStatus":"proved","heading":"Proposition","number":"3.15.2"}
